---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How Greenways handles early-access requests." path="/privacy/">
  <article class="legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy note · August 2026</p><h1>A small form.<br />A clear purpose.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Greenways collects only the information needed to consider and respond to early-access requests.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2><p>Your email address, the creative interests you choose, your consent, and standard technical submission records used for spam prevention.</p>
    <h2>Why we collect it</h2><p>We use these details to understand who is interested in the beta and to contact selected participants. We do not sell this information or use it for unrelated advertising.</p>
    <h2>Who processes it</h2><p>The form is hosted and processed by Netlify as our website hosting provider. Invitations are reviewed and sent manually by Greenways.</p>
    <h2>Retention and your choices</h2><p>We retain a request while the beta is active or until it is no longer useful for that purpose. Ask to see, correct or delete your submission at <a href="mailto:hello@greenways.ai">hello@greenways.ai</a>.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p>If the beta begins using automated campaigns, analytics or additional personal information, this notice will be updated before those changes are introduced.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
